  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-multicol-001-ref": "<style>html, body {\n  color: black;\n  background-color: white;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\nbody { color: red; }\n\n.table {\n  display: table;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  border: blue solid 1pt;\n}\n\n.itable { display: inline-table; }\n.caption { display: table-caption; }\n.cell {\n  display: table-cell;\n  border: inherit;\n}\n.row {\n  display: table-row;\n  border: green dashed 1pt;\n}\n.rowg { display: table-row-group; }\n.head { display: table-header-group; }\n.foot { display: table-footer-group; }\n.col { display: table-column; }\n.colg { display: table-column-group; }\n.flex { display: flex; }\n.iflex { display: inline-flex; }\n.li { display: list-item; }\n.ib { display: inline-block; }\n.inline { display: inline; }\n.columns { columns: 2; height: 4em; }\n.contents {\n  display: contents;\n  align-items: inherit;\n  justify-items:inherit;\n}\n.c1 { color: lime; }\n.c2 { background: blue; color: pink; }\n.c3 { color: teal; }\n.c4 { color: green; }\n.c5 { color: silver; }\n.c6 { color: cyan; }\n.c7 { color: magenta; }\n.c8 { color: yellow; }\n.c9 { color: grey; }\n.c10{ color: black; }\n.b { background: inherit; }\n\n/** This is the only difference between references and non-reference styles */\n.ref .c2 { background: transparent; }\n.ref .b { background:blue; }\n.ref div.contents { display: block; }\n.ref span.contents { display: inline; }\n</style>\n<!-- Imported from: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=907396 -->\n\n\n\n<div style=\"color: red\" class=\"ref\">\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n  <div class=\"contents c1\"><div class=\"contents c2\"><div>1<span>1</span></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"contents c2\"><div>2</div></div>\n  <div class=\"contents c3\"><div>3</div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n  <div class=\"contents c1\"><div class=\"contents c2\"><div>1<span>1</span></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"contents c2\"><div>2</div></div>\n  <div class=\"contents c3\"><div>3</div></div>\n</div>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-multicol-001": "<style>html, body {\n  color: black;\n  background-color: white;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n\nbody { color: red; }\n\n.table {\n  display: table;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  border: blue solid 1pt;\n}\n\n.itable { display: inline-table; }\n.caption { display: table-caption; }\n.cell {\n  display: table-cell;\n  border: inherit;\n}\n.row {\n  display: table-row;\n  border: green dashed 1pt;\n}\n.rowg { display: table-row-group; }\n.head { display: table-header-group; }\n.foot { display: table-footer-group; }\n.col { display: table-column; }\n.colg { display: table-column-group; }\n.flex { display: flex; }\n.iflex { display: inline-flex; }\n.li { display: list-item; }\n.ib { display: inline-block; }\n.inline { display: inline; }\n.columns { columns: 2; height: 4em; }\n.contents {\n  display: contents;\n  align-items: inherit;\n  justify-items:inherit;\n}\n.c1 { color: lime; }\n.c2 { background: blue; color: pink; }\n.c3 { color: teal; }\n.c4 { color: green; }\n.c5 { color: silver; }\n.c6 { color: cyan; }\n.c7 { color: magenta; }\n.c8 { color: yellow; }\n.c9 { color: grey; }\n.c10{ color: black; }\n.b { background: inherit; }\n\n/** This is the only difference between references and non-reference styles */\n.ref .c2 { background: transparent; }\n.ref .b { background:blue; }\n.ref div.contents { display: block; }\n.ref span.contents { display: inline; }\n</style>\n<!-- Imported from: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=907396 -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div style=\"color: red\">\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n  <div class=\"contents c1\"><div class=\"contents c2\"><div>1<span class=\"b\">1</span></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"contents c2\"><div>2</div></div>\n  <div class=\"contents c3\"><div>3</div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"columns\">\n  <div class=\"columns contents\">\n  <div class=\"contents c1\"><div class=\"contents c2\"><div>1<span class=\"b\">1</span></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"contents c2\"><div>2</div></div>\n  <div class=\"contents c3\"><div>3</div></div>\n  </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-oof-001": "<style>\n  div {\n    display: contents;\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    background: red;\n  }\n</style>\n<p>You should see the word PASS and no red below.</p>\n<div>P<span>A</span>S<span>S</span></div>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-oof-002": "<style>\n  div {\n    display: contents;\n    position: fixed;\n    right: 0;\n    background: red;\n  }\n</style>\n<p>You should see the word PASS and no red below.</p>\n<div>P<span>A</span>S<span>S</span></div>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-pass-green-no-red-ref": "<p>You should see the word PASS in green and no red below.</p>\n<div style=\"color:green\"><span>P</span>ASS</div>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-pass-no-red-ref": "<p>You should see the word PASS and no red below.</p>\n<div>P<span>A</span>S<span>S</span></div>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-pass-ref": "<style>\n/* Disable kerning because kerning may differ for different node tree. */\nhtml { font-kerning: none; font-feature-settings: \"kern\" off; }\n</style>\n<p>You should see the word PASS below.</p>\nPASS",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-root-background-ref": "<p>Pass if the background is green.</p>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-root-background": "<style>\n  :root {\n    display: contents;\n    background-image: url(../support/1x1-green.png);\n  }\n</style>\n<p>Pass if the background is green.</p>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-shadow-dom-1-ref": "<style>\nhtml,body {\n  color:black; background-color:white; font:20px/1 monospace; padding:0; margin:0;\n}\n\nspan { color:blue; }\n</style>\n<div>X 1 c</div>\n    <div>a 2 c</div>\n    <div>a 3 Y</div>\n    <div>X 4 Y</div>\n    <div>a 5 Y</div>\n    <div>X <span>6</span> c</div>\n    <div>a <span>7</span> c</div>\n    <div>a <span>8</span> Y</div>\n    <div>X <span>9</span> Y</div>\n    <div>a <span>A</span> Y</div>\n    <div>a <span>1 2</span> B</div>\n    <div>A <span>a 1 2 c</span> B</div>\n    <div>A <span>a 1 a 2 ca 3 c</span> B</div>\n    <div>A <span>a 1 c a 2 c</span> B</div>\n    <div>X <span>a 1 c a 2 c</span> B</div>\n    <div><span>1a 2 c</span></div>\n    <div><span>a 1 c2</span></div>\n    <div>A<span>b</span>c</div>\n    <div>A<span>b</span>c</div>\n    <div><span>b c</span>d</div>\n    <div><span>a </span>b</div>\n    <div><b>One</b><i>Two</i></div>\n    <div><b>One</b><i>Two</i></div>\n    <div><b>One</b><i>Two</i></div>\n    <div><b>One</b><i>Two</i></div>\n    <b style=\"color:blue\">One</b><i style=\"color:blue\">Two</i>Three\n    <div></div>\n    <b style=\"color:green\">V</b>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-sharing-001-ref": "<style>\n  * { display: contents }\n</style>\n<whatever>\n  PASS\n</whatever>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-sharing-001": "<style>\n  * { display: contents }\n</style>\n<br>\n<whatever>\n  PASS\n</whatever>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-state-change-001-ref": "<style>\ndiv {\n  color: green;\n}\n</style>\n<div>\n  This text should be green, there should be no red border at any time.\n</div>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-text-inherit-ref": "<p>The words \"Two\" and \"lines\" should not be on the same line.</p>\nTwo<br>\nlines",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-text-inherit": "<style>\n  div {\n    display: contents;\n    white-space: pre;\n  }\n</style>\n<p>The words \"Two\" and \"lines\" should not be on the same line.</p>\n<div>Two\nlines</div>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-whitespace-inside-inline-ref": "<p>There should be an space between \"Foo\" and \"bar\" below</p>\n<span>Foo bar</span>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-contents-whitespace-inside-inline": "<p>There should be an space between \"Foo\" and \"bar\" below</p>\n<span>Foo<div style=\"display: contents\"> </div>bar</span>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-first-line-002-ref": "<div contenteditable></div>\n<p>The word \"PASS\" should be seen below. There should be no DCHECK\n  failure.</p>\n<p style=\"color: blue;\">PASS</p>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-flow-root-001": "<style type=\"text/css\">\nhtml,body {\n  color:black; background-color:white; font:16px/1 monospace; padding:0; margin:0;\n}\n\n.float {\n  float: left;\n  width: 20px;\n  height: 40px;\n  background: pink;\n}\n\n  </style>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid\">\n  <!-- this tests that the flow-root margins don't collapse with its children. -->\n  <span style=\"display:flow-root; margin: 20px 0\">\n    <div style=\"margin: 20px 0\">x</div>\n  </span>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"border:1px solid\">\n  <!-- this tests that the flow-root grows to fit child floats -->\n  <span style=\"display:flow-root\"><div class=\"float\"></div></span>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"border:1px solid; margin-bottom:20px\">\n  <!-- this tests that a float does not intrude into flow-root box -->\n  <div class=\"float\"></div>\n  <span style=\"display:flow-root; border:1px solid\">x</span>\n</div>\n\n<span>\n  <!-- this tests that a flow-root box is constructed also in the \"ibsplit\" case -->\n  <span style=\"display:flow-root; background:grey;\"><div style=\"margin:20px\">x</div></span>\n</span>\n\n<span style=\"display:flow-root; border:3px solid; height:10px;\">\n  <!-- this tests that a flow-root fills the available width, and that 'height' applies -->\n</span>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-flow-root-002-ref": "<style>\n  .float {\n    background-color: blue;\n    width: 250px;\n    height: 100px;\n  }\n  .left { float: left; }\n  .right { float: right; }\n\n  #outer { position: relative; width: 400px; }\n\n  #zerowidth {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 100px;\n    left: 250px;\n    width: 0;\n    outline: 1px solid black;\n    height: 200px;\n  }\n</style>\n<div id=\"outer\">\n  <div class=\"float right\"></div>\n  <div class=\"float left\"></div>\n  <div id=\"zerowidth\"></div>\n</div>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-flow-root-002": "<style>\n  .float {\n    background-color: blue;\n    width: 250px;\n    height: 100px;\n  }\n  .left { float: left; }\n  .right { float: right; }\n\n  #outer { width: 400px; }\n\n  #zerowidth {\n    display: flow-root;\n    width: 0;\n    outline: 1px solid black;\n    height: 200px;\n  }\n</style>\n<div id=\"outer\">\n  <!-- Two floats are positioned and sized such that there is less than zero empty space \"between\" them. -->\n  <div class=\"float right\"></div>\n  <div class=\"float left\"></div>\n  <div id=\"zerowidth\"></div>\n</div>",
  "wpt/css_display/display-flow-root-dynamic-ref": "A\n<div style=\"display: inline flow-root\">B</div>\nC",
  "wpt/css_display/display-flow-root-list-item-001": "<style type=\"text/css\">\nhtml,body {\n  color:black; background-color:white; font:16px/1 monospace; padding:0; margin:0;\n}\n\nbody { padding-left: 100px; }\n\n.float {\n  float: left;\n  width: 20px;\n  height: 40px;\n  background: pink;\n}\n\n.li { display: flow-root list-item; }\n  </style>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid\">\n  <!-- this tests that the flow-root margins don't collapse with its children. -->\n  <span class=\"li\" style=\"margin: 20px 0\">\n    <div style=\"margin: 20px 0\">x</div>\n  </span>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"border:1px solid\">\n  <!-- this tests that the flow-root grows to fit child floats -->\n  <span class=\"li\"><div class=\"float\"></div></span>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"border:1px solid; margin-bottom:20px\">\n  <!-- this tests that a float does not intrude into flow-root box -->\n  <div class=\"float\"></div>\n  <span class=\"li\" style=\"border:1px solid\">x</span>\n</div>\n\n<span>\n  <!-- this tests that a flow-root box is constructed also in the \"ibsplit\" case -->\n  <span class=\"li\" style=\"background:grey;\"><div style=\"margin:20px\">x</div></span>\n</span>\n\n<span class=\"li\" style=\"border:3px solid; height:10px;\">\n  <!-- this tests that a flow-root fills the available width, and that 'height' applies -->\n</span>"
}